      "widgets_values": [
        "这是 Z-Image-Turbo 扩散模型加载节点。当前工作流使用 BF16 原精度模型，画质稳定，但需要较多显存/内存；显存不足时可开启 ComfyUI 的模型卸载或低显存模式。\n\n文件：z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors\n下载：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors?download=true\n存放：D:\\ComfyUI\\models\\diffusion_models\n\n下载后刷新模型列表，并在本节点选择同名文件。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        -0.9419469833374023,
