      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "我是卡卡，这是一个 Z-Image-Turbo 文生图工作流。请按每个区域里的「卡卡提示」操作。欢迎加我好友一起交流学习，微信：kkcomfy\n\n【使用前准备】\n建议先更新 ComfyUI；下载完成后放入下列目录，再刷新模型列表或重启 ComfyUI。\n\n1. 扩散模型（大模型）\n文件：z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors\n下载：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors?download=true\n目录：D:\\ComfyUI\\models\\diffusion_models\n\n2. 文本编码器\n文件：qwen_3_4b.safetensors\n下载：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors?download=true\n目录：D:\\ComfyUI\\models\\text_encoders\n\n3. VAE\n文件：ae.safetensors\n下载：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors?download=true\n目录：D:\\ComfyUI\\models\\vae\n\n官方模型介绍：https://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo\nComfyUI 权重仓库：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo\n\n本工作流中的下载地址均来自 Hugging Face，并与节点当前选择的文件名对应。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
